                        "entry_id": "a309ecaa-3c4a-36c3-913d-f009eec3207e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Developing at a later time or later in a season, especially than is customary with allied species; specifically (botany), of a plant: flowering late in a season."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
